<title>USA: Wells Financial Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Wells Financial Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WELLS, Minn. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months    Year Ended</p>
<p>					    1996   1995    1996    1995</p>
<p>  Total interest income	     3,793  3,569  14,669  13,489</p>
<p>  Total interest expense	    2,085  2,072   8,146   8,165</p>
<p>  Net interest income after</p>
<p>  provision for loan losses	 1,663  1,452   6,343   5,158</p>
<p>  Total non-interest income	   272    228   1,062     809</p>
<p>  Total non-interest expense	1,067  1,064   5,293   3,855</p>
<p>  Income before income taxes	  868    616   2,112   2,112</p>
<p>  Income tax expense		    387    246     912     842</p>
<p>  Net Income				481    370   1,200   1,270</p>
<p>  EPS					0.24   0.18    0.60    0.50</p>
<p>		    (Dollars in Thousands excpet per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for year ended December 31, 1996 includes a SAIF charge of $1.085 million pretax or $640,000 after tax.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
